#. module: payment_xpago
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:payment_xpago.payment_provider_form
msgid ""
"XPago can deposit each payment in a different account of yours. Odoo reads your accounts from\n"
"                        XPago every hour; they are added and removed in XPago only. At the point of sale, each terminal\n"
"                        can have its own account or let the cashier choose it on each charge."
msgstr ""
"XPago puede depositar cada pago en una cuenta distinta tuya. Odoo lee tus "
"cuentas de XPago cada hora; se agregan y se quitan solo en XPago. En el "
"punto de venta, cada terminal puede tener su propia cuenta o dejar que la "
"cajera la elija en cada cobro."

#. module: payment_xpago
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/payment_xpago/models/payment_transaction.py:0
msgid "XPago captures a hold once; the bank frees the rest on its own."
msgstr ""
"XPago captura una retención una sola vez; el banco libera el resto por su "
"cuenta."

